  "description": "Database-neutral SQL migration engine for EF-free (NativeAOT) Elarion hosts (ADR-0060): embedded V{version}__/R__ script discovery, SHA-256 checksums over line-ending-normalized content, out-of-order and repeatable planning, and the roll-forward execution model (history rows commit with their script — no repair command, no failed-row limbo). Drives a database provider through the IMigrationDatabase seam; a provider package (Elarion.Migrations.PostgreSql, Elarion.Migrations.Sqlite) supplies the SQL and locking. Contains no database driver.",
